\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. My God, the spring of all my joys,
\par The life of my delights,
\par The glory of my brightest days,
\par And comfort of my nights.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In darkest shades, if Thou appear,
\par My dawning is begun;
\par Thou art my soul's bright morning star,
\par And Thou my rising sun.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. The opening heavens around me shine
\par With beams of sacred bliss,
\par If Jesus shows His mercy mine
\par And whispers I am His.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. My soul would leave this heavy clay
\par At that transporting word,
\par Run up with joy the shining way
\par To see and praise my Lord.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Fearless of hell and ghastly death,
\par I'd break through every foe;
\par The wings of love and arms of faith
\par Would bear me conqueror through.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

